Members management gives organization owners and administrators the tools to build and maintain their team. From sending invitations to assigning roles, this section covers everything you need to control who has access to your organization and what they can do.

The members management page is accessible at `apps/web/app/[locale]/(internal)/settings/members/page.tsx`.

## Members management functionality

- ✅ View all current members and their roles
- ✅ Track pending invitations
- ✅ Invite new members via email
- ✅ Resend or cancel pending invitations
- ✅ Assign and update member roles
- ✅ Remove members from the organization
- ✅ RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)
- ✅ Custom roles management (create, edit, delete)

## How It Works

Organizations support multiple members, each with an assigned role that determines their permissions. When you invite someone, they receive an email with a link to join. Once accepted, they become a member and gain access based on their assigned role.

The members page displays two tabs: one for current members and another for pending invitations. This separation makes it easy to manage your existing team while tracking who hasn't yet accepted their invite.

